+  the same size 30 taper and flange.
+- `crates/tools/src/holder_library_hsk.rs`: HSK-A63, HSK-F63, HSK-E40,
+  HSK-E32.
+
+Entries (ER sizes from the one ER table, Weldon bores from the existing
+DIN 6359 / inch bore tables):
